# Playwright Integration Rules

- Test integration points where UI state depends on API responses and mutations.
- Use `page.route` to mock API responses for deterministic positive and negative scenarios.
- Verify request intent (method/payload/endpoint) when user actions trigger backend calls.
- Assert state transitions across loading, success, and error states in the same flow.
- Prefer 3-5 focused tests per feature area instead of broad overlapping tests.
- Avoid visual/pixel assertions; validate behavior and accessibility-visible outcomes.

## Example
```ts
await page.route("**/api/leads*", route => route.fulfill({ status: 200, body: JSON.stringify([]) }));
await expect(page.getByText("No leads found")).toBeVisible();
```
